                                "sense_id": "6e8b639b-b77c-374d-b835-4483f9195653",
                                "text": "And if you were only to see the sums which those thoughtless young lads, who have ten times more money than wit to guide it, throw away on useless nigg-nyes, while thousands around them are pinched for the necessaries of life, it would make the very hair of your head, my dear Archy, stand up like the locks of Medusa."
                            },
                            {
